# Source photography for the menu (~21MB of webp).
# Not tracked: the originals are the designer's, and every one of them is already
# uploaded to the Supabase `menu-images` bucket under menu-v3/, which is what the
# app actually serves. supabase/seed/menu_v3.json records which file became which
# item, so the mapping survives even without the folder.
/Digital_Menu_Item_Images (webp 800)/
